   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "# Parte 3. Revocación y servicio OCSP\n",
    "\n",
    "Un certificado puede dejar de ser fiable antes de caducar (por ejemplo, si roban su clave). La CA lo **revoca** y un servicio **OCSP** responde en línea si un certificado es válido (`good`), está revocado (`revoked`) o es desconocido (`unknown`).\n",
    "\n",
    "### 3.1 Revocación del certificado anterior\n",
    "La CA no permite dos certificados válidos con el mismo nombre. Se guarda una copia del certificado actual y se revoca; en `index.txt` su línea pasa de `V` a `R`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "68c0e7e8",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /content/practica-pki/container\n",
    "cp website.pem website_revocado.pem\n",
    "openssl ca -config openssl.cnf -revoke website_revocado.pem\n",
    "echo \"### index.txt:\"\n",
    "cat demoCA/index.txt"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f02f7bad",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.2 Certificado del responder OCSP\n",
    "Se crea la solicitud del certificado del responder y se le pide a la CA que la firme."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "47fda2a0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /content/practica-pki/container\n",
    "openssl req -batch -new -nodes -out ocsp.csr -keyout ocsp.key -config openssl_ocsp.cnf -extensions v3_OCSP\n",
    "openssl ca -batch -in ocsp.csr -out ocsp.pem -config openssl_ocsp.cnf -extensions v3_OCSP -policy policy_anything\n",
    "echo \"### Certificado del responder:\"\n",
    "openssl x509 -in ocsp.pem -noout -subject -ext extendedKeyUsage"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1c5c9417",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.3 Nuevo certificado del servidor con la dirección del OCSP\n",
    "Se pide un nuevo certificado y la CA lo firma con `openssl_ocsp.cnf`, que añade la URL del responder. Después se reinicia Apache para que use el nuevo certificado."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "5ff3481a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /content/practica-pki/container\n",
    "IP=$(hostname -I | awk '{print $1}')\n",
    "echo \"IP de la máquina: $IP\"\n",
    "openssl req -batch -config website.cnf -new -keyout website.key -out website_req.pem -addext \"subjectAltName=IP:$IP\"\n",
    "openssl ca -batch -config openssl_ocsp.cnf -verbose -cert demoCA/cacert.pem -policy policy_match -out website.pem -infiles website_req.pem\n",
    "echo \"### Extensión con la dirección del OCSP:\"\n",
    "openssl x509 -in website.pem -noout -ext authorityInfoAccess\n",
    "echo \"### index.txt:\"\n",
    "cat demoCA/index.txt\n",
    "apache2ctl restart\n",
    "echo \"Apache reiniciado con el nuevo certificado\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c1a5e171",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.4 Arranque del responder OCSP\n",
    "Se lanza en segundo plano (`&`) escuchando en el puerto 8888; su registro queda en `log.txt`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9db7cbf9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /content/practica-pki/container\n",
    "nohup openssl ocsp -index demoCA/index.txt -port 8888 -rsigner ocsp.pem -rkey ocsp.key -CA demoCA/cacert.pem -text -out log.txt > /dev/null 2>&1 &\n",
    "sleep 2\n",
    "echo \"### Proceso del responder OCSP:\"\n",
    "pgrep -a -f \"openssl ocsp -index\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ee0cce4d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.5 Consulta del estado de los certificados\n",
    "Resultado esperado: `Response verify OK`, `website.pem: good` y `website_revocado.pem: revoked`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "09f51201",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /content/practica-pki/container\n",
    "IP=$(hostname -I | awk '{print $1}')\n",
    "echo \"IP de la máquina: $IP\"\n",
    "echo \"### Certificado actual\"\n",
    "openssl ocsp -CAfile demoCA/cacert.pem -issuer demoCA/cacert.pem -cert website.pem -url http://$IP:8888\n",
    "echo\n",
    "echo \"### Certificado revocado\"\n",
    "openssl ocsp -CAfile demoCA/cacert.pem -issuer demoCA/cacert.pem -cert website_revocado.pem -url http://$IP:8888"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0316ed09",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Registro del responder:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "7fb3eca5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%%bash\n",
    "cd /content/practica-pki/container\n",
    "grep -E \"Serial Number: [0-9A-F]+$|Cert Status|Revocation Time\" log.txt"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "40e68629",
   "metadata": {},
